id: pm-rust-mixed-cleanup-gate
title: Verify cleanup gate coordination across native and published writers
description: The native cleanup gate uses a persistent kernel lease and an empty gate directory. The published 2026.11.18 lock implementation uses an owner receipt inside the gate and a separate age rule. Unify the mixed-writer ownership contract and verify live-writer exclusion and dead-owner recovery with disposable trackers. Round FO verifies the native writer race.
